      "text": "know, and testify that we have seen, John 3:11. what he hath seen and heard, that he testifieth, John 3:32. scriptures … are they which testify of me, John 5:39. Spirit of truth … he shall testify of me, John 15:26. disciple which testifieth of these things, John 21:24. testified and preached the word of the Lord, Acts 8:25. he commanded us to preach … and to testify, Acts 10:42. Paul … testified to the Jews that Jesus was Christ, Acts 18:5. Testifying both to the Jews, and also to the Greeks, Acts 20:21. because we have testified of God that he raised up Christ, 1 Cor. 15:15. I testify again to every man that is circumcised, Gal. 5:3. we also have forewarned you and testified, 1 Thes. 4:6. gave himself a ransom for all, to be testified in due time, 1 Tim. 2:6. he testifieth, Thou art a priest for ever, Heb. 7:17. Spirit of Christ … testified beforehand the sufferings of Christ, 1 Pet. 1:11. testifying that this is the true grace, 1 Pet. 5:12. do testify that the Father sent the Son, 1 Jn. 4:14. Jesus have sent mine angel to testify, Rev. 22:16.",
